WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.565
Step 1. Open the Consents tab.

1.2
00:00:02.565 --> 00:00:08.043
In All Encounters, select View Encounter, then select the Consents tab.

1.3
00:00:08.043 --> 00:00:13.018
By default, this list shows only encounters created today.

2.1
00:00:13.018 --> 00:00:15.541
Step 2. Read the consent cards.

2.2
00:00:15.541 --> 00:00:21.185
Each card shows the first file name and how many other files the consent has.

2.3
00:00:21.185 --> 00:00:25.644
Expired shows when Consent Valid Until is in the past.

3.1
00:00:25.644 --> 00:00:28.918
Step 3. Search the consents by file name.

3.2
00:00:28.918 --> 00:00:34.154
After the first character, the Search existing consent box loses focus.

3.3
00:00:34.154 --> 00:00:37.236
Select it again, and type the rest.

4.1
00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:42.386
Step 4. Open the consent details. Select See Details on the card.

4.2
00:00:42.386 --> 00:00:48.192
Supporting Documents lists the files, and Consent Details shows the category,

4.3
00:00:48.192 --> 00:00:50.728
dates, decision and status.

5.1
00:00:50.728 --> 00:00:57.295
Step 5. View or download a file. View opens the file in the File Preview dialog.

5.2
00:00:57.295 --> 00:01:00.477
Download saves it to your device.
